{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2021-04-19 10:55:00', 'title': "LMC NO. 8 ON NMHC'S TOP 50 DEVELOPERS LIST", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., APRIL 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS THE EIGHTH-LARGEST DEVELOPER OF MULTIFAMILY HOUSING, ACCORDING TO THE NATIONAL MULTIFAMILY HOUSING COUNCIL'S 2021 TOP 50 DEVELOPERS LIST."}